139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 393 0 R
/T (I then discussed potential gaps and opportunities, like merged packaging of lodging and Experiences as deals, and specialized training programs for Experiences hosts. Bettering the app using video reviews overall and specific video testimonials inside the host page, to ensure buyer trust and safety more robustly for a user trying to book at home, as a foreigner, with so many concerns to look after.)
/E (I then discussed potential gaps and opportunities, like merged packaging of lodging and Experiences as deals, and specialized training programs for Experiences hosts. Bettering the app using video reviews overall and specific video testimonials inside the host page, to ensure buyer trust and safety more robustly for a user trying to book at home, as a foreigner, with so many concerns to look after.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
